abstract: >-
  Public redacted reproducibility package for a longitudinal claim-transition protocol
  in AI-assisted mathematical research. The frozen pilot snapshot contains 21 events,
  13 sources and 7 claims, with a deterministic structural validator, mutation tests,
  descriptive analysis and a bounded collaboration agenda.
